  "description": {
   "value": "<p><strong>Cost:</strong> 2,500eb (Very Expensive)</p>\n<p><em>With improvements to synth-muscle connections, you can watch as your centipede-like structure absorbs the impact of each blow.</em></p>\n<p><strong>Grafted Muscle and Bone Lace Cyberware Enhancement.</strong> The user’s Max HP is increased by 5. This can only stack with one other instance of Epimorphic Skeleton. Cannot be installed into FBCs, and is incompatible with Titanium Bones. If the user has two instances of Epimorphic Skeleton, their body functions as if it had one additional installation of Grafted Muscle and Bone Lace for the purposes of Linear Frame Requirements. This can only occur once.</p>\n<p><strong>Enhances:</strong> Grafted Muscle and Bone Lace<br>\n<strong>Option Slots:</strong> 0 (Cyberware Enhancement)</p>\n<p><strong>Foundry notes:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Max HP isn't a modifier an upgrade can apply. Add a bonuses.maxHp Active Effect to the Grafted Muscle and Bone Lace it enhances, or adjust Max HP by hand.</li>\n</ul>\n<p><em>From <a href=\"https://docs.google.com/document/d/13EnSAoiLDsC7zmL-Jr1RqIh_EnuVuFnExqiipDVquMk/edit\">Corgo's 77 Collection V3</a> by Corgopolis (Cyberware &gt; Internal Body Cyberware).</em></p>"
